      <h1>How Bitcoin Mining Works</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Bitcoin mining constructs candidate blocks and searches for proof of work that satisfies the network target. Mining helps order valid transactions and extend the chain, while independently operated nodes decide whether a found block and every transaction inside it follow the consensus rules.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Mining</li><li>Shallow</li><li>Explainer</li><li>11 to 13 minutes</li><li>Reviewed 2026-07-18</li></ul>
